  "title": "RESERVOIR STRIKES A NEW DEAL WITH NACIONAL RECORDS",
  "summary": "Partnership marks a comprehensive expansion in Reservoir’s Latin music strategy, with the acquisition of Nacional’s recorded and publishing catalogs plus a new joint venture. Reservoir Media, Inc. (NASDAQ: RSVR), an award-winning independent music company, today announced the acquisition of the catalog of independent label Nacional Records, along with the catalog of its publishing arm, Canciones […]",
